                        ],
                        "form": "intacte"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "95aec138-461f-4da1-8e20-be004b87cc7a",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "intactes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "94dfe119-bd3d-358e-965f-f84b6d26d9f1",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "À quoi l’on n’a pas touché, dont on n’a rien retranché."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0e03a58-9e3f-4d0d-8a0e-3d8c10c2c758",
                                "sense_id": "94dfe119-bd3d-358e-965f-f84b6d26d9f1",
                                "text": "Le dépôt a été trouvé intact."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb0e9089-7889-4202-b118-968af569a655",
                                "sense_id": "94dfe119-bd3d-358e-965f-f84b6d26d9f1",
                                "text": "Je me disais, devant un objet, un être intact : ils ne sont que recollés, ils ne tiendront pas à la pluie, à la moindre secousse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad0d4e93-a80f-40e0-b4fb-209e3fb037ac",
                                "sense_id": "94dfe119-bd3d-358e-965f-f84b6d26d9f1",
                                "text": "Sébastien vit sur la table un plateau à peu près intact."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "16f2ac48-805d-356f-b554-622616e8a188",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n’a pas souffert d’altération."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f9a0956-4000-404c-815f-b5c1c1c2a011",
                                "sense_id": "16f2ac48-805d-356f-b554-622616e8a188",
                                "text": "On est alors fort étonné de retrouver les morceaux de bismuth intacts, leur aspect extérieur ne diffère en rien de ce qu’il était avant la chauffe […]. Il semble, d’après cela que le bismuth n’a pas fondu."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d78c1c7-4c57-31f2-83ee-792ec00d9003",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie une réputation qui n’a jamais été attaquée, ou sur laquelle la calomnie n’a pu attirer aucun soupçon."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4208de66-95c3-3ed6-a5a1-00c3b573fef9",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est à l’abri de toute sorte de reproche, en parlant de vertu, de probité, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4598e820-891a-4522-91f5-a46c34885a16",
                                "sense_id": "4208de66-95c3-3ed6-a5a1-00c3b573fef9",
                                "text": "De prime abord, Moore l’avait reléguée dans la catégorie des nullardes coincées dont la virginité resterait intacte jusqu’à ce qu'un comptable bedonnant et palot ([…]) survienne et l’amène à céder de haute lutte […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d7dd6c58-690f-3734-851e-5bb5e7b3bf1b",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n’a souffert aucune atteinte, en parlant de l’honneur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39034f1d-7017-38bb-8a08-5ccaf23a8e41",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "À qui l’on ne peut rien reprocher de contraire à la probité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9b95c97-0368-49a1-997e-fad25817de5c",
                                "sense_id": "39034f1d-7017-38bb-8a08-5ccaf23a8e41",
                                "text": "J’aurais voulu te dire tout ce que j’ai gardé de tes offrandes, et le temps passé sur ma jeunesse, et que j’ai pleuré en étendant mon linge, et que nous sommes intacts."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f5276b4-a5eb-3c33-93fd-184d8b43b1ee",
                        "entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Vierge, généralement en parlant d’une femme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78eb7148-ed8d-442e-bd31-2237a4ff99ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "target_lang_word": "intact",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "intact",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db8d432a-7d1e-33fb-99e8-54120b48ffd7",
                                        "entry_id": "9a758ec6-979f-3258-85eb-50a8b50efbe8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Left complete or whole; not touched, defiled, sullied or otherwise damaged."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6dc4281-6ab7-4115-87d3-44c8465c9c82",
                                                "sense_id": "db8d432a-7d1e-33fb-99e8-54120b48ffd7",
                                                "text": "I packed my belongings carefully so that they would survive the move intact."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87b41d17-b399-4310-bbed-ce550b3beee6",
                                                "sense_id": "db8d432a-7d1e-33fb-99e8-54120b48ffd7",
                                                "text": "But Pirates! comes with all the usual Aardman strengths intact, particularly the sense that its characters and creators alike are too good-hearted and sweet to nitpick. The ambition is all in the craft rather than in the storytelling, but it’s hard to say no to the proficiency of that craft, or the mild good cheer behind it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c3f5798-0807-3601-ac9b-4938b15b910a",
                                        "entry_id": "9a758ec6-979f-3258-85eb-50a8b50efbe8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Virginal, having an intact hymen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of female persons"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f07a2ef3-a445-44df-8d02-9530d498024d",
                                                "sense_id": "1c3f5798-0807-3601-ac9b-4938b15b910a",
                                                "text": "She hadn't been... molested? No, no, nothing like that. I have examined her. She is quite intact."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ea02799-0f20-3235-bf7e-e7e800b2e0aa",
                                        "entry_id": "9a758ec6-979f-3258-85eb-50a8b50efbe8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Uncircumcised, having an intact foreskin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d6c1db0-86d8-4e9a-99af-80b8f06cb432",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea02799-0f20-3235-bf7e-e7e800b2e0aa",
                                                "text": "GM, 28, intact, atheist, 5'9\", 140 lbs., seeks similar guy 20-30 for conversation and other forms of communication."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94205712-1a79-37ec-8b01-1000c7d2b0d2",
                                        "entry_id": "9a758ec6-979f-3258-85eb-50a8b50efbe8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not castrated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb097d2f-47e9-4a13-8fdc-f171ae91cac9",
                                                "sense_id": "94205712-1a79-37ec-8b01-1000c7d2b0d2",
                                                "text": "an intact bull"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9bd5be27-002d-4751-84f1-d072574749c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "0082083f-5aca-34bd-9476-756ce016939e",
                        "target_lang_word": "unscathed",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unscathed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "213abafe-63a8-3241-9e87-21049fda5137",
                                        "entry_id": "e07f86ac-13da-3e24-832a-b804bfb4b113",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not harmed or damaged in any way; untouched."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f22ffe64-24e8-4122-b137-49597ec22aae",
                                                "sense_id": "213abafe-63a8-3241-9e87-21049fda5137",
                                                "text": "He was quite relieved to finish the conversation unscathed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe02f046-a3af-4de5-8b61-6e24aa2955b7",
                                                "sense_id": "213abafe-63a8-3241-9e87-21049fda5137",
                                                "text": "On Tyneside, the suburban electric services were relatively unscathed by the conditions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a13e5dd-ab68-4e59-8eb2-27e1a95cf33b",
                                                "sense_id": "213abafe-63a8-3241-9e87-21049fda5137",
                                                "text": "This was not the cagey, cautious approach which had been widely anticipated. Rather, it was a signal that McCoist had reached a fairly significant conclusion – that his only hope of getting through this storm unscathed was to get his fragile team back on the front foot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aac81436-66fe-4095-970e-d7006d8c1e1b",
                                                "sense_id": "213abafe-63a8-3241-9e87-21049fda5137",
                                                "text": "This final running sore through several years did not leave the Queen unscathed, since it was clear that the palace had neglected its duty, either to persuade Charles to give up his long-running affair with Camilla Parker Bowles, or to protect and advise Diana how to cope with the international celebrity that had suddenly been thrust upon her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5eda35b4-f98d-4c3b-b9ff-9bd69feaa16d",
                                                "sense_id": "213abafe-63a8-3241-9e87-21049fda5137",
                                                "text": "De Bruyne had made just one Premier League appearance before he was injured but he came through his 33-minute appearance unscathed to hand Guardiola a welcome boost heading into the second half of the campaign."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "686647c8-2935-4491-92a2-5ed50fcb4a01",
